You don't even really look like the character that you select unless you choose the knight because it's just very obvious that he's wearing that armor.

00:25:15.280 --> 00:25:17.000
Otherwise, you don't look like who you pick.

00:25:17.000 --> 00:25:19.360
It's funny that all three of them, we should have coordinated.

00:25:19.540 --> 00:25:21.820
We should have tried to, like, there's three characters to choose.

00:25:21.900 --> 00:25:23.240
We should have each picked a different one.

00:25:23.380 --> 00:25:26.260
I should at least have that kind of coordination down for this podcast.

