Great. And then, like, story-wise, what the hell is going on here?

00:25:36.820 --> 00:25:39.180
I don't know. I know. I have it in my notes, but I don't think.

00:25:39.320 --> 00:25:43.380
I'm saying, like, I have it in my notes, and that's what's going to help me, like, explain the story if I have to.

00:25:43.800 --> 00:25:44.620
You're playing the game.

00:25:44.820 --> 00:25:51.780
You're just kind of, like, dropped in there, and you're just, like, again, fetch quest style, like, go here, please check on this thing.

00:25:51.940 --> 00:25:52.880
Okay, then go here.

00:25:53.000 --> 00:26:01.300
You know, you're not necessarily, like, there's no lore dump at the beginning of the game of, like, you know, the princess has been kidnapped, and you got to do this.

00:26:01.420 --> 00:26:04.320
And thankfully, I don't think this is one of those princess has been kidnapped games.

00:26:04.320 --> 00:26:10.540
But, like, it is interesting that you're just, they're going for, like, the Legend of Zelda style.

00:26:10.960 --> 00:26:13.120
Yeah. You know, hey, just start the game, you know?

00:26:13.260 --> 00:26:14.960
Like, you just dropped right into it.

00:26:15.040 --> 00:26:18.240
Figure it out. I mean, there is some lore dump.

00:26:18.640 --> 00:26:30.220
Like, you know, if you talk to the old guy at the bar, he'll be like, back in my day, we used to actually, like, be a functional country, and there weren't barbarians running around.

