I think that was a conversation you had in real life.

00:26:37.960 --> 00:26:46.060
Yeah, right? But, no, he says that, and that's kind of, like, a little bit of organic luring.

00:26:46.180 --> 00:26:51.900
I don't really know how much that has to do with what you're doing, especially in that beginning.

00:26:52.080 --> 00:27:00.080
Like, you're just doing kind of, like, you're on a prove-it deal, and that's, like, the prior is, like, oh, go get these gems or whatever.

00:27:00.220 --> 00:27:07.280
And then you can talk to the king, or, like, I guess the vice king, about what, like, what the actual story is about.

00:27:07.340 --> 00:27:11.400
But I did not register what was actually happening or why what I was doing mattered.

