I'm not going back to this game, but I still can see a lot of value in it, but not essential.

00:56:39.720 --> 00:56:47.080
Yeah, the value proposition is there for, like, a, it needed to exist for other games to iterate on it.

00:56:47.120 --> 00:56:56.160
So, I think, like, at the time, especially in 88, it was probably a lot more important and was probably a bigger deal for fans of the genre.

