But this is, this is a world, not just the game itself, but the whole world that it created is, like, lost to time.

00:57:07.160 --> 00:57:24.440
There's no reason to unpack this in 2026 and play around in it because there are so many, you know, more fleshed out versions of what this game is trying to do that are readily available to you on any console of your choice.

00:57:24.440 --> 00:57:31.720
Like, you know, we need games like these to lay down the stones for other games to step on to continue to progress.

