But it is, it is almost completely irrelevant in the 2026 modern gaming conversation.

00:57:40.980 --> 00:57:48.540
So, we played it on the podcast for the historical note that the chronological exploration takes us on.

00:57:48.620 --> 00:57:59.080
But I don't think that there's anything here that I would say it does as well as the games in the same genre as it do today.

00:57:59.080 --> 00:58:02.780
So, for all those reasons, it can't be on the essential games list.

